(7522851, 1202174, 124815, '<td valign="top">Wendy the lighting is so pristine that I truly miss your notes. I do not think that I''ll ever have the patience to set a scene like this without having a real photo studio; perfect background. ISO 100...etc without omitting the challenge of showing good hands posture and quality<br/>As composition, the elements seem sprinkled too evenly as is the quota white to black. This is of course analyzing very carefully an excellent image. I would have implied a story somehow or just go to the bare bone of sifting the flour. I just saw that eliminating the salt and eggs (and perhaps changing the location of the measuring cup) and leaving more room might make it more film noir. It''s about the passionate baker in the middle of the night. This is of course splitting hair in admiration of a good work.<br/>Boy, I wish I could accomplish this. I seldom use a tripod (the drudgery!). Perhaps we will have to have a photo session one day together.</td>', 'Wendy the lighting is so pristine that I truly miss your notes. I do not think that I''ll ever have the patience to set a scene like this without having a real photo studio; perfect background. ISO 100...etc without omitting the challenge of showing good hands posture and qualityAs composition, the elements seem sprinkled too evenly as is the quota white to black. This is of course analyzing very carefully an excellent image. I would have implied a story somehow or just go to the bare bone of sifting the flour. I just saw that eliminating the salt and eggs (and perhaps changing the location of the measuring cup) and leaving more room might make it more film noir. It''s about the passionate baker in the middle of the night. This is of course splitting hair in admiration of a good work.Boy, I wish I could accomplish this. I seldom use a tripod (the drudgery!). Perhaps we will have to have a photo session one day together.', '2017-07-11 13:02:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7522852, 1202154, 124815, '<td valign="top">I wish I was there I said to myself when looking at this. I thought that it was in the Dolomites. Spinach dumplings! I wish you took a close up also.</td>', 'I wish I was there I said to myself when looking at this. I thought that it was in the Dolomites. Spinach dumplings! I wish you took a close up also.', '2017-07-11 13:07:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7522853, 1202175, 138630, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> Didn''t vote or even look at this challenge, but if I had I''d have loved this one the most. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ubique</a> on this.  <br/> <br/>I love this one so much - great sense of place and person and moment - and the tones are just lovely.  A hearty congratulations on the very well deserved Blue.  I would have loved this one in a Free Study or any challenge you could shoehorn it into, which is not always the case in these narrowly defined challenges.<br/> <br/>It wasn''t a decision not to vote - I just didn''t get around to it.  Now, looking at some of the entries, your included of course, I realize what I missed.  The addition of "black and white" to the challenge brings an extra WOW factor, IMO.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: Didn''t vote or even look at this challenge, but if I had I''d have loved this one the most.   I''m with  ubique on this.   I love this one so much - great sense of place and person and moment - and the tones are just lovely.  A hearty congratulations on the very well deserved Blue.  I would have loved this one in a Free Study or any challenge you could shoehorn it into, which is not always the case in these narrowly defined challenges. It wasn''t a decision not to vote - I just didn''t get around to it.  Now, looking at some of the entries, your included of course, I realize what I missed.  The addition of "black and white" to the challenge brings an extra WOW factor, IMO.   ', '2017-07-11 13:08:23.000000', NULL, 0),
