(7522996, 1201771, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes well to the challenge.<br/> <br/>I love your viewpoint Susan well chosen, it makes for an original image. I also love the long exposure it makes the image much more dynamic and engaging. Although the desat is necessary for the challenge the sepia toning works well. All the technical stuff is well chosen and effective. Dont suppose theres any of that delicious sounding ice cream left?</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes well to the challenge. I love your viewpoint Susan well chosen, it makes for an original image. I also love the long exposure it makes the image much more dynamic and engaging. Although the desat is necessary for the challenge the sepia toning works well. All the technical stuff is well chosen and effective. Dont suppose theres any of that delicious sounding ice cream left?', '2017-07-12 07:29:21.000000', NULL, 0),
